uint64_t get_idle_frames() const;
```

Added the possibility to specify a custom delta time in the `move_and_slide` function.

@akien-mga not sure if this one can be part of 3.2 but it's just a minor fully retro compatible API addition.

This work has been kindly sponsored by IMVU.

```
int n = 1;
float v = vec2(1.0, 0.5)[n]; // USING VARIABLE
```

```
int n[] = {1, 0, 0};
float v = vec2(1.0, 0.5)[n[0]]; // USING ARRAY
```

```
